{
    "title": "iCenter Master",
    "description": "iCenter Master is designed with iOS style and very user-friendly user interface, this app empowers you to effortlessly control all your apps.\r\n\r\nWith its iOS style design, iCenter Master offers a seamless and intuitive interface that is easy to navigate. Say goodbye to the hassle of managing multiple settings and apps separately - iCenter Master Fast puts everything you need in one convenient place. Streamline your device management and enjoy a smoother and more efficient user experience with this all-in-one solution.\r\n\r\nBluetooth Connectivity: Easily pair and connect your device to Bluetooth-enabled accessories such as headphones, speakers, or smart devices.\r\nWi-Fi: Use control panel to browse the web, watch videos and more.\r\nDo Not Disturb: Silence notifications and calls when you need focused time or a peaceful environment.\r\nAirplane Mode Activation: Disable all wireless communications with a single tap.\r\nPortrait Orientation Lock: Prevent your screen from rotating when you move your device.\r\nShortcut: Add the app you want to quickly access from control center.\r\nSimplified Sound & Brightness Control: Easily adjust brightness and sound with a dedicated slider to suit different environments,\r\nCalculator: Tap numbers and functions in the Calculator, just like a standard calculator.\r\nControl audio: Play, pause, and control the volume of your media and more.\r\nFlashlight:  A single tap from the custom control center app to get extra light when you need it.\r\nCamera: Never miss a chance to take your best shot with quick access to the camera.\r\n\r\niCenter Master requires the use of the AccessibilityService API to provide the best experience.\r\n\r\n- When the user chooses to set the control center entrance in the upper right corner of the screen, in order to avoid conflicts with other programs and affect operations, you need to authorize the accessibility service permission to ensure the smooth operation of the control center. If you choose other locations, you do not need to provide this permission.\r\n- We promise not to collect any personal information through accessibility services. User privacy and data security are always our top priority.\r\n\r\nIf you have any questions about our user experience and privacy terms, please feel free to contact us.",
    "descriptionHTML": "iCenter Master is designed with iOS style and very user-friendly user interface, this app empowers you to effortlessly control all your apps.<br><br>With its iOS style design, iCenter Master offers a seamless and intuitive interface that is easy to navigate. Say goodbye to the hassle of managing multiple settings and apps separately - iCenter Master Fast puts everything you need in one convenient place. Streamline your device management and enjoy a smoother and more efficient user experience with this all-in-one solution.<br><br>Bluetooth Connectivity: Easily pair and connect your device to Bluetooth-enabled accessories such as headphones, speakers, or smart devices.<br>Wi-Fi: Use control panel to browse the web, watch videos and more.<br>Do Not Disturb: Silence notifications and calls when you need focused time or a peaceful environment.<br>Airplane Mode Activation: Disable all wireless communications with a single tap.<br>Portrait Orientation Lock: Prevent your screen from rotating when you move your device.<br>Shortcut: Add the app you want to quickly access from control center.<br>Simplified Sound &amp; Brightness Control: Easily adjust brightness and sound with a dedicated slider to suit different environments,<br>Calculator: Tap numbers and functions in the Calculator, just like a standard calculator.<br>Control audio: Play, pause, and control the volume of your media and more.<br>Flashlight:  A single tap from the custom control center app to get extra light when you need it.<br>Camera: Never miss a chance to take your best shot with quick access to the camera.<br><br>iCenter Master requires the use of the AccessibilityService API to provide the best experience.<br><br>- When the user chooses to set the control center entrance in the upper right corner of the screen, in order to avoid conflicts with other programs and affect operations, you need to authorize the accessibility service permission to ensure the smooth operation of the control center. If you choose other locations, you do not need to provide this permission.<br>- We promise not to collect any personal information through accessibility services. User privacy and data security are always our top priority.<br><br>If you have any questions about our user experience and privacy terms, please feel free to contact us.",
